 <h3><u>Nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya hussain, ya hussain..(2)<br> Hussain imam hussain, haider..(8)<br> Hussain imam hussain<br> haider haider haider<br> Ya hussain<br> Ghode se jab zamee'n pe gire shahe karbala<br> shahe karbala<br> nikle madina chodke sultan e ambiya<br> sultane ambiya<br> Haider chale najaf se baqayya se fatima<br> baqayya se fatima<br> gunji ba waqt e asr ye jibreel ki sadaa<br> har imteha se guzar gaya..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>1. Ye wo hussain hai eid pe jisko<br> jannat se kapde bheje khuda<br> haye ghareebi dasht e bala mein<br> hoga abhi pamaal e jafa<br> yahan kafan bhi na payega..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>2. Haan ye wahi quran e mubee'n hai<br> jisko padha karte the rasool<br> jiske liye tabdeel kiye hai<br> rabbe jali ne apne usool<br> khuda se hargiz nahi juda..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>3. Naaz uthaye jiske khuda ne<br> jiske liye naaqa the nabi<br> usko mile is karbobala mein<br> daaghe pisar aur tishna labi<br> hazaar zakhme utha gaya..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>4. Zulf e nabi ho jiska khilona<br> jiska bichona arsh e ola<br> pusht e faras se jab wo gira to<br> uska badan teero pe ruka<br> zameen par bhi na aa saka..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>5. Ho jiski maa ke meher mein kausar<br> aur wo khud sardar e jina<br> aath peher se wo pyasa hai<br> mehve buka hai khushk zabaa'n<br> ghira laeeno mein bekhata..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>6. Paala jise aanchal mein chupakar<br> binte nabi ne mere khuda<br> aaj sawa neze pe suraj<br> jaye amaa'n hai sirf qaza<br> zameen e maqtal pe soyega..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>7. Jiska padhe qur'aan qasida<br> jiske fazael mein hai azaa'n<br> uske liye duniya ne uthaye<br> teer o tabar talwar o sina<br> sina pe qur'aa sunayega..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain</p> 
  <p>8. Haan ye sada irfan aur mazhar<br> sunke buka karte the nabi<br> sheh ke gale par chal gaya khanjar<br> roke bahan ye kehne lagi<br> tamaam waade nibha gaya..(2)</p> 
  <p>zehra o ali ke dil ka chayn<br> hussain, hussain, hussain, hussain<br> Qatl hua be jurm o khata..(2)<br> nabi ka nawasa pyaara hussain..(2)</p> 
  <p>haye kyaa zulm mohammad ke nawase pe hua<br> dasht mein gunj uthi ye zainab e muztar ki sadaa</p> 
  <p>halq e shahedee'n kata<br> wa hussaina<br> pyaaso pe khanjar chala<br> wa hussaina<br> arey, lut gayi aale iba<br> wa hussaina<br> aaiye shere khuda<br> wa hussaina, wa hussaina<br> wa hussaina, wa hussaina</p> 
